<title>NETHERLANDS: AHOLD Q2 NET RISES 18.3 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>AHOLD Q2 NET RISES 18.3 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>ZAANDAM, Netherlands 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.95 vs   0.83</p>
<p>    Net profit			   121.3  vs 102.5</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  7.83 vs   6.76</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   243.6  vs 201.3</p>
<p>Note - Ahold was expected by analysts to produce a net</p>
<p>profit of between 110.7 and 123.0 million guilders in Q2 1996.</p>
<p>-- FIRST HALF 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.07 vs   1.82</p>
<p>    Net profit			   259.7  vs 222.1</p>
<p>    Interim div (guilders)   0.26 + $0.13 vs   0.24 + $0.11</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		  17.31 vs  15.32</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   517.6  vs  434.7</p>
<p>    Interest charge		    136.2  vs 120.2</p>
<p>    Tax				    102.8  vs  79.8</p>
<p>    Minorities (charge)		 18.9  vs  12.6</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
